{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Medium mixed breed","breed_primary":"Medium Mixed Breed Cross","description_text":"Since I'm a long stay pup, my adoption fee has been reduced! Visit me today to find out my favorite treats and how you can take me home!\n\nMy foster writes: Foxxy is a sweet potato of a dog! She is a lover and will shower you with kisses if you let her. She is fully house trained, crate trained, and great on the leash. Occasionally, she'll press pause on her nap for an adorable play session but it's cuddles and belly rubs that she values the most. Foxxy mama is a simple girl, give her a comfy couch and some love, and she's yours forever. Anybody would be so incredibly lucky to have her by their side.\n\nWhat my friends at ACC say about me:\n\nI would appreciate slow introductions to new people and places to help me feel safe.\n\nI would do best in a home with only adult humans.\n\nI prefer to call the shots and enjoy coming to you when I'm ready for pets.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=3%2C16&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=12&searchType=4&animalid=202657","id":"436f4a7f7934fb5e7537d3e5ea92dab3","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/d6af1ec21b9c4d63b5334d46adbf075a-1786730880-1786730905-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/901b946bab684555bf5e5985876cbffd-1786730880-1786730899-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/765f6fdcd38343faa8f8278de26a8c97-1786730883-1786730883-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/49733766cf694e83bc35d1d2988b01ad-1786730882-1786730882-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/fb8364aafdda43b38e5bb156b3468498-1786730882-1786730882-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/6f48dfd4116b4380a28256a2b48d24b0-1786730882-1